{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Also now, according to your words, so it is.</b> So is the law among us according to your words, that you are all liable in the matter: ten in whose possession the theft is found with one of them — all are seized. But I will act beyond the line of the law: <b>with whomsoever it is found</b>, he shall be my slave, and you shall be clear."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:20:10.155488290Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}